<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1855995767"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1573696699"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="THE ANSWER"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="澤野弘之 / Laco"/><amll:meta key="album" value="86―エイティシックス― オリジナル・サウンドトラック"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:38.810"><div begin="00:36.160" end="03:38.810"><p begin="00:36.160" end="00:41.000" itunes:key="L1">We've spent our lives in shadows<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们终此一生都活在阴影之中</span></p><p begin="00:41.000" end="00:45.770" itunes:key="L2">Good people off the radar<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">善良的人</span></p><p begin="00:45.770" end="00:49.780" itunes:key="L3">I see you now as the pressure builds<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随着压力不断累积</span></p><p begin="00:49.780" end="00:53.710" itunes:key="L4">The doubts I had, looking back<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回想起我心中的疑虑</span></p><p begin="00:53.710" end="00:55.870" itunes:key="L5">I didn't understand your reason<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并不明白你的缘由</span></p><p begin="00:55.870" end="00:57.900" itunes:key="L6">You always asked me every season<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一个季节 你总是追问着我</span></p><p begin="00:57.900" end="00:59.850" itunes:key="L7">When all the madness is all over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当所有疯狂都宣告结束时</span></p><p begin="00:59.850" end="01:02.840" itunes:key="L8">What is... Your answer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的答案是什么</span></p><p begin="01:02.840" end="01:05.350" itunes:key="L9">Where do we go? Don't need to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们该何去何从</span></p><p begin="01:05.350" end="01:07.770" itunes:key="L10">Just keep flow, can we go back?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不必知晓</span></p><p begin="01:07.770" end="01:09.870" itunes:key="L11">I'll cover you, you cover me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能否回到过去</span></p><p begin="01:09.870" end="01:11.940" itunes:key="L12">Pick it up! Keep your head, pick it up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你保护着我</span></p><p begin="01:11.940" end="01:14.370" itunes:key="L13">You talk to me, I talk to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持冷静</span></p><p begin="01:14.370" end="01:16.670" itunes:key="L14">It's gon' be our Xanadu!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对你畅所欲言</span></p><p begin="01:16.670" end="01:18.880" itunes:key="L15">Where do we go? Is it with you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们该何去何从</span></p><p begin="01:18.880" end="01:21.040" itunes:key="L16">Your answer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否与你同行</span></p><p begin="01:21.040" end="01:23.030" itunes:key="L17">Yes, they lied to us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们欺骗了我们</span></p><p begin="01:23.030" end="01:25.680" itunes:key="L18">But I don't wanna nap in the dirt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我不想在乱世之中昏昏欲睡</span></p><p begin="01:25.680" end="01:27.460" itunes:key="L19">Yes, they lied to us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们欺骗了我们</span></p><p begin="01:27.460" end="01:29.820" itunes:key="L20">We still got a lot of work<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们依然任重而道远</span></p><p begin="01:29.820" end="01:32.170" itunes:key="L21">First, we must beat the legion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先 我们必须打败整个军团</span></p><p begin="01:32.170" end="01:34.520" itunes:key="L22">Then, show the world we're human<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后 告诉全世界 我们是活生生的人</span></p><p begin="01:34.520" end="01:36.660" itunes:key="L23">First, we must beat the legion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先 我们必须打败整个军团</span></p><p begin="01:36.660" end="01:41.600" itunes:key="L24">Show the world, we like it rough<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉全世界 我们狂野不羁</span></p><p begin="01:41.600" end="01:46.070" itunes:key="L25">So many dreams were shattered<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">许多梦想已经幻灭</span></p><p begin="01:46.070" end="01:50.730" itunes:key="L26">You saved us when it mattered<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关键时刻 你拯救了我们</span></p><p begin="01:50.730" end="01:54.960" itunes:key="L27">We still can't see how this story ends<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们依然无法看清这个故事的结局</span></p><p begin="01:54.960" end="01:58.660" itunes:key="L28">When shall you tell me your name?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你何时愿意告诉我你的名字</span></p><p begin="01:58.660" end="02:00.710" itunes:key="L29">I didn't understand your reason<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并不明白你的缘由</span></p><p begin="02:00.710" end="02:03.190" itunes:key="L30">You always asked me every season<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一个季节 你总是追问着我</span></p><p begin="02:03.190" end="02:04.830" itunes:key="L31">When all the madness is all over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当所有疯狂都宣告结束时</span></p><p begin="02:04.830" end="02:08.120" itunes:key="L32">What is... Your answer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的答案是什么</span></p><p begin="02:08.120" end="02:10.570" itunes:key="L33">Where do we go? Don't need to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们该何去何从</span></p><p begin="02:10.570" end="02:12.620" itunes:key="L34">Just keep flow, can we go back?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不必知晓</span></p><p begin="02:12.620" end="02:15.030" itunes:key="L35">I'll cover you, you cover me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能否回到过去</span></p><p begin="02:15.030" end="02:16.840" itunes:key="L36">Pick it up! Keep your head, pick it up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你保护着我</span></p><p begin="02:16.840" end="02:19.430" itunes:key="L37">You talk to me, I talk to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持冷静</span></p><p begin="02:19.430" end="02:21.790" itunes:key="L38">It's gon' be our Xanadu!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对你畅所欲言</span></p><p begin="02:21.790" end="02:24.200" itunes:key="L39">Where do we go? Is it with you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们该何去何从</span></p><p begin="02:24.200" end="02:26.000" itunes:key="L40">Your answer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否与你同行</span></p><p begin="02:26.000" end="02:28.360" itunes:key="L41">Yes, they lied to us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们欺骗了我们</span></p><p begin="02:28.360" end="02:30.760" itunes:key="L42">But I don't wanna nap in the dirt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我不想在乱世之中昏昏欲睡</span></p><p begin="02:30.760" end="02:32.730" itunes:key="L43">Yes, they lied to us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们欺骗了我们</span></p><p begin="02:32.730" end="02:35.140" itunes:key="L44">We still got a lot of work<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们依然任重而道远</span></p><p begin="02:35.140" end="02:37.240" itunes:key="L45">First, we must beat the legion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先 我们必须打败整个军团</span></p><p begin="02:37.240" end="02:39.520" itunes:key="L46">Then, show the world we're human<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后 告诉全世界 我们是活生生的人</span></p><p begin="02:39.520" end="02:41.680" itunes:key="L47">First, we must beat the legion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先 我们必须打败整个军团</span></p><p begin="02:41.680" end="02:46.480" itunes:key="L48">Show the world, we like it rough<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉全世界 我们狂野不羁</span></p><p begin="02:46.480" end="02:50.600" itunes:key="L49">Enough! Enough! Enough! Enough!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">足够坚强</span></p><p begin="02:50.600" end="02:55.440" itunes:key="L50">Enough! Enough! Enough! We're tough enough!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们已足够坚强</span></p><p begin="02:55.440" end="02:59.600" itunes:key="L51">Enough! Enough! Enough! Enough!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">足够坚强</span></p><p begin="02:59.600" end="03:02.570" itunes:key="L52">Enough! Enough!</p><p begin="03:02.570" end="03:04.260" itunes:key="L53">Your answer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的答案呢</span></p><p begin="03:04.260" end="03:06.670" itunes:key="L54">Where do we go? Don't need to know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们该何去何从</span></p><p begin="03:06.670" end="03:08.770" itunes:key="L55">Just keep flow, can we go back?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不必知晓</span></p><p begin="03:08.770" end="03:10.830" itunes:key="L56">I'll cover you, you cover me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能否回到过去</span></p><p begin="03:10.830" end="03:13.200" itunes:key="L57">Pick it up! Keep your head, pick it up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你保护着我</span></p><p begin="03:13.200" end="03:15.530" itunes:key="L58">You talk to me, I talk to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">保持冷静</span></p><p begin="03:15.530" end="03:17.600" itunes:key="L59">It's gon' be our Xanadu!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对你畅所欲言</span></p><p begin="03:17.600" end="03:20.020" itunes:key="L60">Where do we go? Is it with you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们该何去何从</span></p><p begin="03:20.020" end="03:22.130" itunes:key="L61">Your answer?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否与你同行</span></p><p begin="03:22.130" end="03:24.140" itunes:key="L62">Yes, they lied to us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们欺骗了我们</span></p><p begin="03:24.140" end="03:26.640" itunes:key="L63">But I don't wanna nap in the dirt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我不想在乱世之中昏昏欲睡</span></p><p begin="03:26.640" end="03:28.610" itunes:key="L64">Yes, they lied to us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 他们欺骗了我们</span></p><p begin="03:28.610" end="03:30.860" itunes:key="L65">We still got a lot of work<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们依然任重而道远</span></p><p begin="03:30.860" end="03:33.180" itunes:key="L66">First, we must beat the legion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先 我们必须打败整个军团</span></p><p begin="03:33.180" end="03:35.760" itunes:key="L67">Then, show the world we're human<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然后 告诉全世界 我们是活生生的人</span></p><p begin="03:35.760" end="03:37.690" itunes:key="L68">First, we must beat the legion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">首先 我们必须打败整个军团</span></p><p begin="03:37.690" end="03:38.810" itunes:key="L69">Show the world, we like it rough<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉全世界 我们狂野不羁</span></p></div></body></tt>